m.add_item_tts("supershield, Protect yourself from the attacks of your opponents by creating a force field. Spells used with wand are not included. 100 aura required for this spell.","supershield");
m.add_item_tts("aura_shield, by is_using this spell a barior will form around you, protecting you from the attacks of various animals and creatures. This enchantment requires 150 aura.","aura_shield");
m.add_item_tts("shield_smasher, a lightning fast spell, able to break the targeted player's shields with a single hit. requires 180 aura.","shield_smasher");
